        "code": "// Calls radarChart1's actions and reads its values by name, as RunJS code in a saved app does.\nawait components.radarChart1.clearClickedPoint();\nawait components.radarChart1.setLoading(true);\nawait components.radarChart1.setLoading(false);\nawait components.radarChart1.setDisable(true);\nawait components.radarChart1.setDisable(false);\nawait components.radarChart1.setVisibility(false);\nawait components.radarChart1.setVisibility(true);\nreturn { \"isVisible\": components.radarChart1.isVisible, \"isLoading\": components.radarChart1.isLoading, \"isDisabled\": components.radarChart1.isDisabled, \"clickedDatum\": components.radarChart1.clickedDatum, \"clickedDataPoint\": components.radarChart1.clickedDataPoint };",
